---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const version = 'v1.0.0';
const size = '9.8 MB';
const dmg =
  'https://github.com/AadiXC0DE/Sift/releases/download/v1.0.0/Sift_1.0.0_universal.dmg';
const appleLogo = `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 384 512" width="15" height="15" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M318.7 268.7c-.2-36.7 16.4-64.4 50-84.8-18.8-26.9-47.2-41.7-84.7-44.6-35.5-2.8-74.3 20.7-88.5 20.7-15 0-49.4-19.7-76.4-19.7C63.3 141.2 4 184.8 4 273.5q0 39.3 14.4 81.2c12.8 36.7 59 126.7 107.2 125.2 25.2-.6 43-17.9 75.8-17.9 31.8 0 48.3 17.9 76.4 17.9 48.6-.7 90.4-82.5 102.6-119.3-65.2-30.7-61.7-90-61.7-91.9zm-56.6-164.2c27.3-32.4 24.8-61.9 24-72.5-24.1 1.4-52 16.4-67.9 34.9-17.5 19.8-27.8 44.3-25.6 71.9 26.1 2 49.9-11.4 69.5-34.3z"/></svg>`;
---
<SiteLayout title="Download" description="Download Sift for macOS. A 9.8 MB native Gmail client with no bundled browser." path="/download">
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Download Sift</h1>
    <p>{version} · {size} · macOS 13 Ventura or newer · Apple Silicon and Intel.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card-block" style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href={dmg}><span set:html={appleLogo} />Download for Mac</a>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/AadiXC0DE/Sift/releases">All releases</a>
    <span class="pill-row"><span class="chip">9.8 MB</span><span class="chip">universal</span><span class="chip">free beta</span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Install</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open the downloaded DMG and drag <strong>Sift</strong> into Applications.</li>
      <li>Launch Sift. On first run macOS may ask you to confirm opening an app downloaded from the internet.</li>
      <li>Connect your Gmail with an app password, which takes about two minutes.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Connect Gmail</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><span class="step-n">1</span><p>Turn on 2-Step Verification in your <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/signinoptions/two-step-verification">Google account settings</a>.</p></li>
      <li><span class="step-n">2</span><p>Create an app password named Sift on the <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords">App passwords page</a>. Google shows the 16 letter password once.</p></li>
      <li><span class="step-n">3</span><p>Paste it into Sift and press Connect.</p></li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Checksums</h2>
    <p>Every release ships a <code>SHA-256</code> sum next to the DMG on GitHub. The download button points at an immutable release asset, so the hash you verify is the file you get.</p>

    <h2>Updates</h2>
    <p>Sift checks for updates in the background and installs them on quit. You can also download any version from the <a href="https://github.com/AadiXC0DE/Sift/releases">releases page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
